n 136,433 ETH long bets, as technical indicators suggest a short-term ETH price rally toward $4,000.', 'KEYWORDS': '', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1765185313, 'UPDATED_ON': 1765186947, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 16, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cointelegraph', 'NAME': 'Cointelegraph', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cointelegraph.png', 'URL': 'https://cointelegraph.com/rss', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1382054400, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1765190566, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760450177}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 24, 'NAME': 'ETH', 'CATEGORY': 'ETH'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 55361901, 'GUID': 'https://www.investing.com/news/cryptocurrency-news/iaero-protocol-launches-token-sweeper-distributes-5-of-liq-supply-to-stakers-4391845', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1765185101, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/106/default.png', 'TITLE': 'iAero Protocol Launches Token Sweeper, Distributes 5% of LIQ Supply to Stakers', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': '', 'URL': 'https://www.investing.com/news/cryptocurrency-news/iaero-protocol-launches-token-sweeper-distributes-5-of-liq-supply-to-stakers-4391845', 'SOURCE_ID': 106, 'BODY': '', 'KEYWORDS': '', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764878854, 'UPDATED_ON': 1765185101, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 106, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'investing_comcryptonews', 'NAME': 'Investing.com Crypto News', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/106/default.png', 'URL': 'https://www.investing.com/rss/news_301.rss', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1505088000, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1765190585, 'CREATED_ON': 1754907212, 'UPDATED_ON': 1754907484}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 13, 'NAME': 'BLOCKCHAIN', 'CATEGORY': 'BLOCKCHAIN'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 55500145, 'GUID': 'https://cryptopotato.com/?p=1422570', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1765185080, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/27/55500145.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Dollar in Danger? ‘Debasement’ Searches Skyrocket to All-Time Highs', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Martin Young', 'URL': 'https://cryptopotato.com/dollar-in-danger-debasement-searches-skyrocket-to-all-time-highs/', 'SOURCE_ID': 27, 'BODY': 'Google searches for dollar “debasement” soared this quarter to the highest level in history, reported BarChart on Sunday. The chart, sourced from Bloomberg and Google Trends, has been widely shared across crypto social media today. A search for the keyword “debasement” on Google Trends actually shows that it spiked in 2012 and has spiked again recently as fears grow. Searching for the term “dollar debasement” shows the highest ever levels in recent weeks in the United States. Google Searches for Dollar “Debasement” soared this quarter to the highest level in history pic.twitter.com/qJJFqd5b5h — Barchart (@Barchart) December 6, 2025 DXY Down … M2 Supply Up Fears and curiosity have grown this year as the greenback has had a rough ride, losing more than 10% against certain currencies. The US Dollar Index (DXY), a measure of the US dollar against a basket of other currencies, has declined since the beginning of this year. It remained range-bound from late 2022 to late 2024, rising to a two-year high of 110 in January 2025. However, it plunged by more than 12% to a three-year low of 96.3 in mid-September and remains only slightly higher than that level currently, according to Tradingview. This means that the dollar has steadily weakened against many other currencies worldwide this year. Additionally, the phrase “debasement trade” came to light this year as investors sought ways to distance themselves from the plunging currency. In October, entrepreneur Anthony Pompliano said financial institutions are quickly waking up to the debasement trade, realizing that “no one is ever going to stop printing money.” This is clearly evident in the M2 money supply chart , which has reached an all-time high of $22.3 trillion. With the Federal Reserve ending QT (quantitative tightening) and beginning QE (quantitative easing), liquidity and money printing will increase, further debasing the dollar. Strong Macro Setup For Crypto “This chart is one of the biggest signals for crypto right now,” said analyst “Bull Theory” on Sunday. “If the Fed begins T-bill purchases on top of rate cuts, the liquidity impact will be massive,” they added. This will weaken the dollar and cause a liquidity expansion, which, historically, has been very bullish for crypto markets. “This is one of the strongest macro setups Bitcoin and altcoins have had since the 2020-21 cycle.” The post Dollar in Danger? ‘Debasement’ Searches Skyrocket to All-Time Highs appeared first on CryptoPotato .', 'KEYWORDS': 'AA News|Crypto News|Federal Reserve', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'NEGATIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1765185400, 'UPDATED_ON': 1765185401, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 27, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cryptopotato', 'NAME': 'Crypto Potato', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cryptopotato.png', 'URL': 'https://cryptopotato.com/category/crypto-news/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1458086400, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 57, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1765190547, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1711621041}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 26, 'NAME': 'FIAT', 'CATEGORY': 'FIAT'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 210, 'NAME': 'MACROECONOMICS', 'CATEGORY': 'MACROECONOMICS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 55500003, 'GUID': 'https://en.coin-turk.com/?p=208389', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1765185027, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/79/55500003.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Japanese Bonds Surge to Record Heights, Threatening Crypto Stability', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Ömer Ergin', 'URL': 'https://en.coin-turk.com/japanese-bonds-surge-to-record-heights-threatening-crypto-stability/', 'SOURCE_ID': 79, 'BODY': \"Japan's bond yields hit a record high, risking global financial stability. Rising borrowing costs strain Japan's massive debt management. Continue Reading: Japanese Bonds Surge to Record Heights, Threatening Crypto Stability The post Japanese Bonds Surge to Record Heights, Threatening Crypto Stability appeared first on COINTURK NEWS .\", 'KEYWORDS': 'Cryptocurrency News', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'NEGATIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1765185084, 'UPDATED_ON': 1765185085, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 79, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cointurken', 'NAME': 'CoinTurk News', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/79/default.png', 'URL': 'https://en.coin-turk.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1765190574, 'CREATED_ON': 1689939795, 'UPDATED_ON': 1690273097}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 6, 'NAME': 'ASIA', 'CATEGORY': 'ASIA'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 55500004, 'GUID': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/?p=237567', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1765185011, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/82/default.png', 'TITLE': 'Crucial Update: Upbit Revises the BORA Token Circulation Plan', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Editorial Team', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/upbit-bora-token-circulation-update/', 'SOURCE_ID': 82, 'BODY': 'BitcoinWorld Crucial Update: Upbit Revises the BORA Token Circulation Plan In a significant move for the BORA ecosystem, South Korea’s leading cryptocurrency exchange, Upbit, has just announced a major update. The platform has implemented crucial changes to the BORA token circulation plan following a direct request from the BORA development team. This isn’t just a routine notice; it’s a strategic shift that could reshape tokenomics and influence future value. For investors and enthusiasts, understanding this update is essential for navigating the next phase of BORA’s journey. What Exactly Changed in the BORA Token Circulation Plan? Upbit’s announcement centers on modifying the schedule and mechanics of how BORA tokens enter the circulating supply. While the exchange did not publish granular details, such updates typically involve adjustments to: Vesting Schedules: Altering the unlock timeline for tokens allocated to team members, advisors, or early investors. Emission Rates: Changing the pace at which new tokens are released through staking rewards, ecosystem grants, or other incentives. Supply Management: Implementing new mechanisms for token burns, buybacks, or treasury management to control inflation. The core takeaway is that the BORA team proactively sought this change, signaling a deliberate strategy to optimize long-term ecosystem health rather than a reaction to market pressure. Why Does a Token Circulation Plan Matter So Much? Think of a token’s circulation plan as its economic heartbeat. It directly controls the balance between available supply and market demand. A well-managed BORA token circulation plan builds investor confidence by demonstrating foresight and discipline. Conversely, a poorly communicated or overly inflationary plan can lead to sell pressure and erode value. This update suggests the BORA team is prioritizing sustainable growth, which is a positive signal for the project’s maturity. What Are the Potential Impacts for BORA Holders? For current and prospective BORA holders, this revision has several key implications. First, it may reduce the risk of sudden, large-volume token unlocks that can dilute price. Second, it could extend the project’s runway by ensuring resources are distributed strategically over time. However, the specific impact depends entirely on the details. Is the new plan more conservative or more aggressive? The market will need clarity. Therefore, the community should watch for official communications from the BORA team that explain the rationale and new tokenomics model in detail. How Does This Reflect Broader Trends in Crypto? This move aligns with a growing industry emphasis on responsible tokenomics . After the excesses of 2021-2022, projects are now judged heavily on their supply management. A transparent and investor-friendly BORA token circulation plan can be a major competitive advantage. It shows that the team is learning from past market cycles and is committed to building a durable ecosystem, not just short-term hype. This is especially crucial for projects like BORA, which is deeply integrated into the gaming and digital content space, where user adoption depends on stable token utility. What Should You Do Next as an Investor? Do not panic or make impulsive decisions based on a headline. Instead, adopt a measured approach. First, seek out the primary source documentation from both Upbit and the official BORA channels. Second, analyze how the changes align with the project’s 2024 roadmap and development goals. Third, consider how this affects your personal investment thesis for BORA. Does this update increase your confidence in the team’s long-term vision? Responsible investing in crypto requires digging beneath the announcement to understand the ‘why’ behind the change. In summary, Upbit’s update to the BORA token circulation plan is a proactive, strategic decision that underscores the project’s evolution. While the precise effects on token price will unfold over time, the action itself signals a mature approach to ecosystem management. For the crypto community, it serves as a reminder that foundational tokenomics are just as important as technological promises. The true test will be in the execution and communication of this new plan in the months ahead. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Q1: What is a token circulation plan? A: A token circulation plan is a schedule that outlines how and when a cryptocurrency’s total supply will be released into the market. It includes details on vesting for teams, investor unlocks, staking rewards, and other emission mechanisms. Q2: Why did the BORA team request this change from Upbit? A: While not explicitly stated, teams typically request such changes to optimize tokenomics for long-term health. This could mean slowing down inflation, extending project runway, or better aligning token releases with ecosystem milestones. Q3: Will this update directly increase the BORA token price? A: Not necessarily. A well-managed circulation plan can reduce sell-side pressure and build confidence, which are positive fundamentals. However, price is influenced by many factors, including overall market sentiment, adoption, and Bitcoin’s trajectory. Q4: Where can I find the official details of the new plan? A> You should monitor the official BORA project blog, whitepaper updates, and their official social media channels (like Twitter/X) for the most detailed and authoritative information. Upbit’s announcement is the first step, but the project itself will provide the full context. Q5: Does this affect BORA tokens held on other exchanges? A: Yes. Changes to the fundamental tokenomics and emission schedule of BORA affect all tokens, regardless of where they are held or traded. The circulation plan is a property of the blockchain asset itself. Q6: Is this a common practice in the cryptocurrency industry? A> Yes. As projects mature and market conditions change, it is becoming increasingly common for teams to revise their tokenomics. This reflects a more professional and responsive approach to project management compared to the early days of crypto. Ready to dive deeper into smart tokenomics and market-moving updates? If you found this breakdown of the BORA circulation plan helpful, share it with your network on X (Twitter) or Telegram. Helping others understand these crucial developments strengthens the entire crypto community. What’s your take on this update? Share your thoughts with us! To learn more about the latest trends in altcoin tokenomics and project development, explore our article on key developments shaping the future of blockchain gaming and digital asset ecosystems. This post Crucial Update: Upbit Revises the BORA Token Circulation Plan first appeared on BitcoinWorld .', 'KEYWORDS': 'Crypto News|#Upbit|BORA|CRYPTOCURRENCY|SOUTH KOREA|Tokenomics', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1765185086, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 82, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'bitcoinworld', 'NAME': 'Bitcoin World', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/82/default.png', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1765190574, 'CREATED_ON': 1698066984, 'UPDATED_ON': 1747932437}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 25, 'NAME': 'EXCHANGE', 'CATEGORY': 'EXCHANGE'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 55499953, 'GUID': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/?p=237571', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1765184956, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/82/default.png', 'TITLE': 'Bybit and Circle Forge Strategic Partnership to Advance Global USDC Adoption', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'chainwire', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/bybit-and-circle-forge-strategic-partnership-to-advance-global-usdc-adoption/', 'SOURCE_ID': 82, 'BODY': 'BitcoinWorld Bybit and Circle Forge Strategic Partnership to Advance Global USDC Adoption DUBAI, UAE, Dec. 8, 2025 /PRNewswire/ — Bybit , the world’s second-largest cryptocurrency exchange by trading volume, today announced a strategic partnership with an affiliate of Circle Internet Group, Inc. (‘Circle’) (NYSE:CRCL), a global financial technology firm and the issuer of USDC through its regulated entities. The partnership aims to expand USDC access across Bybit’s global ecosystem, strengthen liquidity of the world’s largest regulated stablecoin[1], and reinforce Bybit’s position as a regulatory-compliant platform committed to transparency and trust. As part of this partnership, Bybit will enhance USDC liquidity across spot and derivatives markets, enabling a more efficient trading environment for retail and institutional users. The two companies will also roll out a series of campaigns and initiatives to increase the utility of USDC across Bybit’s products and services. The partnership will further extend to fiat on- and off-ramp solutions, combining Circle’s infrastructure and networks of partners with Bybit’s global reach to simplify deposits and withdrawals across key markets. Bybit users will then benefit from greater speed, transparency, and efficiency when converting between local currencies and digital assets. Bybit also plans to expand USDC integration across its ecosystem, including Bybit Earn for savings, Bybit Card for cashback rewards, and Bybit Pay for everyday transactions — while reinforcing its commitment to compliance and responsible innovation. In addition, Bybit was among the first wave of more than one hundred companies to join the public testnet of Circle’s Arc network, a new layer-1 blockchain purpose-built for stablecoin-native finance. Arc’s public testnet launched in October 2025, with broad-based engagement and collaboration from across the financial and economic system, deep infrastructure support, and global participation. Regulatory Compliance as a Cornerstone of Innovation Bybit recently secured a full Virtual Asset Platform Operator License from the UAE’s Securities and Commodities Authority (SCA), marking a major milestone in its expansion in the Middle East and positioning it as the first global exchange to secure this level of regulatory approval in the region. In addition, Bybit has expanded its regulatory oversight across the European Economic Area (EEA), Turkey, and other jurisdictions around the world. These developments demonstrate Bybit’s long-term commitment to aligning with global regulatory standards and bridging traditional finance with the digital asset economy. USDC is a digital asset fully backed by highly liquid cash and cash-equivalent assets, and is redeemable 1:1 with the U.S. dollar. The reserve assets are held with trusted financial institutions, and monthly attestation by independent third parties provide a high degree of transparency. Ben Zhou, Co-founder and CEO of Bybit , said: “Bybit’s partnership with Circle represents a major milestone in our mission to offer a fully compliant, liquid, and user-friendly ecosystem. From trading to payments to savings, we are integrating USDC to power the next phase of our platform’s growth and stability.” Jeremy Allaire, Chairman, Co-founder and CEO of Circle , added: “At Circle, we are powering the future of internet activity with enterprise-grade infrastructure and stablecoins built for scale. Together, Circle and Bybit are making it easier for retail and institutional users to access and use USDC with the confidence, transparency, and speed they expect.” Looking ahead, Bybit and Circle continue to explore deeper integrations to unlock new opportunities for cross-chain liquidity and institutional-grade financial solutions. [1]\\xa0USDC is an internet-native, fully-reserved, regulated digital dollar that leverages blockchain networks to enable businesses, developers, and individuals to conduct near-real-time, low-cost global transactions. It is a leading, fully-reserved global stablecoin issued through Circle’s regulated affiliates. To learn more about using or accessing USDC, visit USDC.com . To learn more about Circle’s regulatory authorizations, visit Circle’s Licenses page . #Bybit / #CryptoArk About Bybit Bybit is the world’s second-largest cryptocurrency exchange by trading volume, serving a global community of over 70 million users. Founded in 2018, Bybit is redefining openness in the decentralized world by creating a simpler, open and equal ecosystem for everyone. With a strong focus on Web3, Bybit partners strategically with leading blockchain protocols to provide robust infrastructure and drive on-chain innovation. Renowned for its secure custody, diverse marketplaces, intuitive user experience, and advanced blockchain tools, Bybit bridges the gap between TradFi and DeFi, empowering builders, creators, and enthusiasts to unlock the full potential of Web3. Discover the future of decentralized finance at Bybit.com . For more details about Bybit, please visit Bybit Press For media inquiries, please contact: media@bybit.com For updates, please follow: Bybit’s Communities and Social Media Discord | Facebook | Instagram | LinkedIn | Reddit | Telegram | TikTok | X | Youtube This post Bybit and Circle Forge Strategic Partnership to Advance Global USDC Adoption first appeared on BitcoinWorld .', 'KEYWORDS': 'Press Release', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1765184980, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': 